{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22309","headline":"西明寺牡丹花时忆元九 · 白居易","name":"西明寺牡丹花时忆元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年题名处，今日看花来。\n一作芸香吏，三见牡丹开。\n岂独花堪惜，方知老闇催。\n何况寻花伴，东都去未回。\n讵知红芳侧，春尽思悠哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}